      <TableCell>Addresses lists the network addresses that have been bound to the Gateway. This list may differ from the addresses provided in the spec under some conditions:   * no addresses are specified, all addresses are dynamically assigned   * a combination of specified and dynamic addresses are assigned   * a specified address was unusable (e.g. already in use)</TableCell>
