      <TableCell>Conditions describe the current conditions of the Gateway. Implementations should prefer to express Gateway conditions using the <code>GatewayConditionType</code> and <code>GatewayConditionReason</code> constants so that operators and tools can converge on a common vocabulary to describe Gateway state. Known condition types are: * "Accepted" * "Programmed" * "Ready"</TableCell>
      </TableRow>
